From 652500347056153a5057e20539a7b3c25c3843fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gambtho <Thomas.Gamble@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:15:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] app: Add product GitHub OAuth capability grants

Port the final private OAuth grants from Azure/aks-desktop#1048 at
27b0484bb5dcf3cca32a27d4af667c42139b2572 onto current Headlamp.

Keep client identity product-owned and OAuth default-off. Reuse verified
plugin capabilities so only exact trusted identities receive the grant;
navigation and window close revoke in-flight authorization.
