From 8a369c84a6a39b1889c4f660f30139f8b190185a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gambtho <Thomas.Gamble@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:15:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] app: Add capability-bound GitHub browser OAuth

Port the PKCE and private-result host implementation from AKS Desktop
PR 1048 at 27b0484bb5dcf3cca32a27d4af667c42139b2572.

Bind state and verifier to each flow, recheck authorization before token
delivery, and settle cancellation even when browser launch stalls.
Keep packaged callbacks on the product protocol and loopback in dev only.
Reject unrepresentable token expiry with a sanitized diagnostic.
