From: gambtho <Thomas.Gamble@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:15:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] frontend: Inject private GitHub OAuth plugin facade

Port the final plugin facade from Azure/aks-desktop#1048 at
27b0484bb5dcf3cca32a27d4af667c42139b2572. Capture the preload bridge
before executing plugins and inject only into the exact granted identity.

Keep token callbacks local to each facade and return token-free sign-in
status. Exercise real loader execution with granted and ungranted sources,
including the browser-only path.
